<title>POLAND: BIG shareholders vote for 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>BIG shareholders vote for 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) voted to earmark 11.4 million zlotys for the 1996 dividend, despite the management's proposal to skip a payout, a BIG official said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>BIG had a net profit of 55.2 million zlotys in the financial year ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>BIG's general shareholders meeting decided on Tuesday to earmark 39.2 million zlotys for reserve capital and 4.6 million for banking risk fund.</p>
